<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $42-1/2 (FIM 188.98).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $42-1/2 (FIM 188.98).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed $0-1/8 lower at $42-1/4 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 188.98 markka. In Helsinki on Friday Nokia closed up unchanged at 190.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed up $0-1/8 at $33-3/4 on Wall Street overnight. The price equals about 75.48 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.40 markka at 76.70.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS was untraded in New York. In Helsinki on Friday, Rauma closed 0.40 markka lower at 96.50.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
